    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix broken internal links (WebXR, SVGElement, WebAssembly, XSLT)]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44830</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44830"/>
        <updated>2026-07-20T05:27:21.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189964965?u=5e030a50f854f5d4d5c0c9e3e0d2599fe830e4f2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Fixes internal links pointing to nonexistent pages, found by checking every <code class="notranslate">/en-US/docs/</code> link against both the file tree and <code class="notranslate">_redirects.txt</code>:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><strong>WebAssembly</strong>: <code class="notranslate">Tag</code> docs linked <code class="notranslate">exnref</code> via <code class="notranslate">Reference/Types/exnref</code>; the page lives at <code class="notranslate">Reference/Value_types/exnref</code> (matching the links already used in the exception handling and tag definition docs).</li>
<li><strong>XSLT</strong>: <code class="notranslate">&lt;xsl:stylesheet&gt;</code> docs linked <code class="notranslate">&lt;xsl:for-each-group&gt;</code>, an XSLT 2.0 element MDN does not document; converted to plain code text.</li>
<li><strong>SVGElement</strong>: the events list included <code class="notranslate">abort</code>, <code class="notranslate">resize</code>, <code class="notranslate">scroll</code>, and <code class="notranslate">unload</code>, whose pages do not exist (these events were dropped from SVG2); removed those entries, keeping <code class="notranslate">error</code> and <code class="notranslate">load</code> which have pages.</li>
<li><strong>WebXR</strong>: four pages linked the deleted "Using gamepads in WebXR applications" article; retargeted to the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebXR_Device_API/Inputs#advanced_controllers_using_the_gamepad_object" rel="nofollow">Advanced controllers using the gamepad object</a> section of the Inputs guide, where this content now lives.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Not touched: links to plausibly-planned pages (<code class="notranslate">MediaTrackConstraints.resizeMode</code>, MathML global attributes, CycleTracker tutorial parts, <code class="notranslate">import/source</code>) and the ~60 broken links in the WebDriver reference, which look like they need a maintainer decision (happy to file a separate issue about those).</p>]]></content>
        <author>
            <name>rajanpanth</name>
            <email>rajanpanth@noreply.github.com</email>
            <uri>https://github.com/rajanpanth</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2026-07-20T05:26:57.000Z</published>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix grammar: "a HTML" → "an HTML" (13 pages)]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44828</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44828"/>
        <updated>2026-07-20T05:17:31.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189964965?u=5e030a50f854f5d4d5c0c9e3e0d2599fe830e4f2&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">Fixes indefinite article usage before vowel-sound initialisms: "a HTML" → "an HTML" in 12 pages and "a XML" → "an XML" in the XSLT common errors guide.</p>
