        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF153 adds support for the <code class="notranslate">farthest-corner</code> and <code class="notranslate">closest-corner</code> radius values for <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/basic-shape/ellipse" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">ellipse()</code></a> and <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Values/basic-shape/circle" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">circle()</code></a> in Nightly in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2037673" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2037673</a></p>
