        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Issue 34532 additional content script limitations]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44822</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44822"/>
        <updated>2026-07-20T15:15:55.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This change adds details to the content scripts page's limitation section on running scripts in <code class="notranslate">about:</code>, <code class="notranslate">data:</code>, and <code class="notranslate">blob:</code> pages. This is a follow-up that details the new behavior introduced with:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1475831" rel="nofollow">Bug 1475831</a> WebExtension: content scripts should be injected in data URL pages</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1897113" rel="nofollow">Bug 1897113</a> Content scripts should only run in blob:-URLs if match_origin_as_fallback is true</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1896669" rel="nofollow">Bug 1896669</a> "Dark Background and Light Text" add-on stops working</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1853411" rel="nofollow">Bug 1853411</a> Implement matchOriginAsFallback in the scripting.registerContentScripts API)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Details of the match origins fallback settings were previously added in <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/34491#top" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/34491/hovercard">Docs for content script injection into data URL pages</a> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2380904285" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34491" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/34491/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/34491">#34491</a>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
